    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600480/extras/5863ea3101d9e90dd515e4550bacec25.poster.avif?t=1712677475\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600480/extras/5863ea3101d9e90dd515e4550bacec25.webm?t=1712677475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600480/extras/5863ea3101d9e90dd515e4550bacec25.mp4?t=1712677475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>                       <strong><u>Journey Through a World Reclaimed by Nature and Madness</u></strong><br><br>Prepare to embark on a mesmerizing journey into the heart of darkness as Whisper, a cloaked enigma draped in shadows, you'll find yourself in a world on the brink, a realm left unchecked for far too long. All cosmic life hangs on the balance of light and darkness. The blinding irradiated illumination that sparks existence across the cosmos, and the enigmatic darkness, who's emissaries are dispatched to worlds that have reached their 'inevitable' human conclusions.<br>But, when a single world seemingly slips far past it's planned reset, Our silent emissary is dispatched to uncover the keys to this worlds fate. Will you shut out the light for good, or forge your own moral choices within the darkness?<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600480/extras/71f6a1127826ea70a72e4e5853d5f774.poster.avif?t=1712677475\" width=600 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600480/extras/71f6a1127826ea70a72e4e5853d5f774.webm?t=1712677475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600480/extras/71f6a1127826ea70a72e4e5853d5f774.mp4?t=1712677475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>This 2D pixel art Metroidvania adventure beckons you to explore a realm of atmospheric, nonlinear wonder. Navigate branching paths, each concealing secrets waiting to be uncovered. With a vibrant pixel art style, paying homage to the classics while crafting an utterly immersive experience.<br>Accompanied by a soundtrack that adds depth and emotion to every moment of your journey. <br><br>Drawing inspiration from the timeless cinematic magic of Studio Ghibli, This world is more than meets the eye. It's a place where nature has reclaimed forgotten ruins, where ancient civilizations lie hidden beneath layers of mystery, and where the enigmatic and bizarre coexist harmoniously.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600480/extras/cd66caa873042cb82c2dd9c663fb72e9.poster.avif?t=1712677475\" width=600 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600480/extras/cd66caa873042cb82c2dd9c663fb72e9.webm?t=1712677475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600480/extras/cd66caa873042cb82c2dd9c663fb72e9.mp4?t=1712677475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Your adventure is defined by your choices, shaped by your exploration, and illuminated by the nostalgia of classic pixel art. Uncover this worlds secrets, engage diverse hostile foes, and forge a connection with the life you seek to extinguish.<br><br>Are you ready to forge your own fate in the dark?<br><br><strong><i>Game Features</i></strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A large interconnected world filled with mystery and wonder.<br></li><li>Smooth platforming and fast-paced combat.<br></li><li>Vibrant and colorful pixel art.<br></li><li>Use your sword, shadow bow, and hidden spells to fight bizarre foes.<br></li><li>Collect 'Relics' by defeating enemies and finding hidden treasure.<br></li><li>Purchase items and abilities to reach new heights, or hone your combat prowess.<br></li><li>NO soulslike elements, the game prioritizes fun and adventure over frustrating mechanics.<br></li><li>A beautiful soundtrack that brings the world to life.<br></li><li>Multiple endings that require you to make your own moral decisions.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600480/extras/5863ea3101d9e90dd515e4550bacec25.poster.avif?t=1712677475\" width=600 height=252 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600480/extras/5863ea3101d9e90dd515e4550bacec25.webm?t=1712677475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600480/extras/5863ea3101d9e90dd515e4550bacec25.mp4?t=1712677475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>                       <strong><u>Journey Through a World Reclaimed by Nature and Madness</u></strong><br><br>Prepare to embark on a mesmerizing journey into the heart of darkness as Whisper, a cloaked enigma draped in shadows, you'll find yourself in a world on the brink, a realm left unchecked for far too long. All cosmic life hangs on the balance of light and darkness. The blinding irradiated illumination that sparks existence across the cosmos, and the enigmatic darkness, who's emissaries are dispatched to worlds that have reached their 'inevitable' human conclusions.<br>But, when a single world seemingly slips far past it's planned reset, Our silent emissary is dispatched to uncover the keys to this worlds fate. Will you shut out the light for good, or forge your own moral choices within the darkness?<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600480/extras/71f6a1127826ea70a72e4e5853d5f774.poster.avif?t=1712677475\" width=600 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600480/extras/71f6a1127826ea70a72e4e5853d5f774.webm?t=1712677475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600480/extras/71f6a1127826ea70a72e4e5853d5f774.mp4?t=1712677475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>This 2D pixel art Metroidvania adventure beckons you to explore a realm of atmospheric, nonlinear wonder. Navigate branching paths, each concealing secrets waiting to be uncovered. With a vibrant pixel art style, paying homage to the classics while crafting an utterly immersive experience.<br>Accompanied by a soundtrack that adds depth and emotion to every moment of your journey. <br><br>Drawing inspiration from the timeless cinematic magic of Studio Ghibli, This world is more than meets the eye. It's a place where nature has reclaimed forgotten ruins, where ancient civilizations lie hidden beneath layers of mystery, and where the enigmatic and bizarre coexist harmoniously.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600480/extras/cd66caa873042cb82c2dd9c663fb72e9.poster.avif?t=1712677475\" width=600 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600480/extras/cd66caa873042cb82c2dd9c663fb72e9.webm?t=1712677475\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2600480/extras/cd66caa873042cb82c2dd9c663fb72e9.mp4?t=1712677475\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Your adventure is defined by your choices, shaped by your exploration, and illuminated by the nostalgia of classic pixel art. Uncover this worlds secrets, engage diverse hostile foes, and forge a connection with the life you seek to extinguish.<br><br>Are you ready to forge your own fate in the dark?<br><br><strong><i>Game Features</i></strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A large interconnected world filled with mystery and wonder.<br></li><li>Smooth platforming and fast-paced combat.<br></li><li>Vibrant and colorful pixel art.<br></li><li>Use your sword, shadow bow, and hidden spells to fight bizarre foes.<br></li><li>Collect 'Relics' by defeating enemies and finding hidden treasure.<br></li><li>Purchase items and abilities to reach new heights, or hone your combat prowess.<br></li><li>NO soulslike elements, the game prioritizes fun and adventure over frustrating mechanics.<br></li><li>A beautiful soundtrack that brings the world to life.<br></li><li>Multiple endings that require you to make your own moral decisions.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Embark on a vibrant 2D pixel odyssey as Whisper, an emissary of the darkness. Explore an atmospheric, nonlinear world with branching paths and hidden wonders. Engage in fast-paced combat and smooth platforming in this nostalgia-infused Metroidvania adventure.",
